ABOUT THE JOB
We're seeking Senior DevOps Engineers in Hanoi who have had a proven track record of running critical shared application platforms in a production cloud environment who will take a team-first approach and can act as a multiplier, making other engineers better at their craft.
At NAB, we believe success comes from our people. We're committed to supporting your talent and skills through your career, as you help us build a culture that affects change for our customers and for the community too.
YOUR JOB RESPONSIBILITIES
Define/implement tools and processes to standardize and automate the way project software is developed, built, tested, and deployed;
Ensure a homogeneous way of implementing continuous integration and/or continuous delivery across projects;
Assist with the design and development of resilient, secure, supportable, and scalable systems;
Automate infrastructure deployments and rollbacks for all developed work assuming responsibility for process support;
Lead investigations into production incidents with assistance from the development team;
Proactively manage any risks to the production environment;
Continually improve the supportability of our systems by feeding improvements back into the design and development cycles.

requirements_raw:
Requirements:
1.Systems Thinking
- Strong end-to-end systems thinking: application → network → infrastructure;
- Root cause analysis mindset, clear technical communication;
- Software development background (backend/full-stack) is a big plus.
2.Operations Experience (2+ years)
- Linux administration and troubleshooting (must-have);
- Containers & Kubernetes: deployment, operation, debugging;
- CI/CD & automation: GitLab CI / Jenkins / GitHub Actions; scripting in Python, Go, or Shell;
- Infrastructure as Code: Terraform, Ansible;
- Observability: Prometheus, Grafana, ELK, or similar;
- Databases & middleware: SQL Server, Redis, Kafka, RabbitMQ, Nginx/HAProxy;
- Incident response: on-call experience, post-incident reviews;
- Experience with a meaningful subset is enough — nobody has all of it.
3.AI-Native Mindset
- Daily use of AI tools (Claude Code, Copilot, Cursor, or similar) to boost productivity: debugging, automation, runbooks, incident analysis;
- Able to get good results from AI and verify output before applying to production;
- Bonus: built AI-assisted tooling or automation for the team.
Nice to Have
- GitOps (ArgoCD/Flux);
- API Gateway (APISIX, Kong);
- Security practices: secrets management, image scanning, least-privilege access;
- Internal tools / self-service platform experience.

description_raw:
Responsibilities:
KiotViet wishes to transfer a massive power of technology to every business model in Vietnam and Southeast Asia through our simple and effective solutions. KiotViet is committed itself to creating efficient, convenient products for micro, small and medium-size businesses. In over 13 years, with more than 1500 people who form KiotViet in present, we understand that our members of all time are the foundation of KiotVietnowadays and a launchpad for reaching a better KiotViet in the future. KiotViet is committed to creating a work environment that shares success, shares responsibilities.
We are looking for some DevOps Engineers to join our DevOps team. Joining us, you will have a chance to build and maintain one of the biggest infrastructure for ecommerce in Vietnam. Our teams deploy new code many times a day, and our production scale is massive. Hundreds of thousands of merchants will see your work within minutes. As a DevOps engineer, you will be involved in ensuring reliability of the whole system.
What you will do:
- Set the standards with teams for building resilient, debuggable systems: set up Devops CI/CD pipelines, manage infrastructure as code;
- Respond to automated alerts and take actions;
- Manage ongoing incidents, using your understanding of KiotViet to involve the right teams and resolve as quickly as possible;
- Ensure that we never fail for the same reason twice;
- Knowledge of common web vulnerabilities, audit our infrastructure for security issues and keep it safe.

